  "description": "Large, light-filled, south facing, 2 bedroom penthouse apartment in the sought-after development of Trimbleston.  It offers total security and peace of mind. Close to Dundrum Shopping Centre, St Killian's Euro Campus, UCD, LUAS, M50 & Sandyford Industrial Estate. No 11 bus stop immediately outside development\r\n\r\n\r\nHigh Celings throughout, entrance hall, large living/dining/kitchen area with door to balcony. Master bedroom with ensuite, extensive fitted wardropes & built in TV and doors to balcony. Main bathroom with bath and shower. Second bedroom with built-in wardrobes. Solid wooden floors throughout. Very significant storage in loft, access via Styra-stairs. Extensive views of the Dublin mountains. Secure underground parking spaces.  Must be viewed.",
